```
===================================================================
Detection Name: Double-Extension Phishing Payload Execution
Author: SOC Team
Data Source: index=edr_sysmon (Sysmon Operational Event Logs)
Event IDs: 1 (ProcessCreate), 11 (FileCreate)
MITRE ATT&CK: T1566 (Phishing / Spearphishing Attachment)
Severity: High
Description: Identifies creation and execution of files disguised 
             with double extensions (e.g., .pdf.exe, .docx.exe, .xlsx.exe)
             commonly delivered via email phishing.
===================================================================
```
index=edr_sysmon (EventCode=1 OR EventCode=11) (Image="*.pdf.exe" OR TargetFilename="*.pdf.exe")
| table _time, host, User, Image, CommandLine, TargetFilename
| sort - _time
